Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:53:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): cover resolved classes and forwarded historical
 fields [daveey]

Known-wall preclaim authority follows the resolved class, not diagnostic reason labels; retain review and active quota episode custody. Forward legacy titles with neutral operative titles and inert evidence, and serialize parent handoffs at the receiving policy boundary.

Five whys: reason allowlists and body-only serialization left equivalent class and forwarding fields uncovered. Existing probes tested default/explicit and recovery producers, not pattern/profile/retry or actual remote_args-to-create. Unchanged independent probes: 7 pass/5 fail before; focused 58/0 after, all 36 importing/facade files 1000/0 retries off, expanded lossless forwarding and active no-write controls 10/0. Full scripts/check 21 gates green. Fleet cleanup/deployment acceptance remains open.
